Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: AudioReach: walk FullIO topology records safely

Derive framing from the shipped FullIO v19c binary of
geocausa/SP11X1e-audio@3232e1dacdeb580a10a9cb8d4756a4518a7bd83e.
This stage validates private record framing and deliberately rejects FullIO
graphs: no control links, calibration writes or higher gain are enabled.

